r their game tactics, sharpen their reaction speed, and perfect every shot \u2014 all within a realistic, dynamic VR setting.\n\nWhether you're practicing powerful baseline rallies, fine-tuning your lobs and drop shots, or training your split-step timing, this app simulates high-intensity scenarios to boost your confidence and decision-making under pressure.", "short_description": "This immersive virtual tennis training environment is designed to help players of all levels master their game tactics, sharpen their reaction speed, and perfect every shot \u2014 all within a realistic, dynamic VR setting.\n\nWhether you're practicing powerful baseline rallies, fine-tuning your lobs and drop shots, or training your split-step timing, this app simulates high-intensity scenarios to boost your confidence and decision-making under pressure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.moments-athletics.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Moments Athletics", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.moments-athletics.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23951768721116416"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821115_3925541121094556_3380845814489112615_n.png